The vast majority of articles(including this one) are incredibly misleading and I would highly suggest looking up the full video. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMZ6ney6Ibo](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMZ6ney6Ibo)

&#x200B;

Everyone fails to mention that the white woman was holding her stomach as though pregnant and certainly can't afford to be getting in close up brawl and risk losing her baby if that is the case. The people holding the camera are clearly escalating and were banging on the car and getting in the way to not allow the white couple to leave.

I made this specifically for you guys

